      "GroupOrder": 1,
      "SpeakerName": "八惠",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "《美式笑话～让你成为派对主角！～》《落语百选》……/n《吐槽与装傻之道》《古今东西谐音梗》……有这么多应该够了。",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1131",
      "BgmFileName": "103",
      "VoiceFileName": "20003040010",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "104"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000304002,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000304,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 2,
      "SpeakerName": "八惠",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "美式笑话……感觉有点像潘达和流石呢。/n这种能一来一回不断接话的关系，我果然很向往。",
      "SeFileName": "470",
      "VoiceFileName": "20003040020",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "104"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000304003,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000304,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 3,
      "SpeakerName": "八惠",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "落语是通过故事展开本身的趣味来吸引人吗……。",
      "SeFileName": "470",
      "VoiceFileName": "20003040030",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "104"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000304004,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000304,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "SpeakerName": "八惠",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "然后还有误会型装傻……啊，也有给小孩子看的笑话。",
      "SeFileName": "470",
      "VoiceFileName": "20003040040",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "104"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000304005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000304,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "八惠",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『面无表情地说“布偶会说话”之类绝对不可能的事』/n『即使对方笑着否认，也继续面无表情地说下去』……吗。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20003040050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "104"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000304006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000304,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "八惠",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "原来如此，绝对不可能发生的笑点，小孩子也容易理解，/n反复几次还能让笑点更有层次。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20003040060",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "104"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000304007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000304,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "八惠",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "每一本都很有意思……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20003040070",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "104"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000304008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000304,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "八惠",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "问题是，要怎么把这些内容运用到对话里……嗯……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20003040080",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "104"
    },
